WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.125 --> 00:00:02.753
♪♪

00:00:03.337 --> 00:00:05.005
♪♪

00:00:08.133 --> 00:00:10.135
There's a primal urge
in all of us... 

00:00:10.135 --> 00:00:11.136
To explore.

00:00:15.140 --> 00:00:16.725
Some say private citizens

00:00:16.725 --> 00:00:18.727
have no business
in space exploration.

00:00:19.269 --> 00:00:20.604
I emphatically disagree.

00:00:20.854 --> 00:00:22.814
We have a historic
opportunity...

00:00:22.814 --> 00:00:24.733
The first mission to Mars.

00:00:24.733 --> 00:00:27.402
NASA's joining Helios
and the Soviets.

00:00:27.402 --> 00:00:29.529
A three way race to Mars.

00:00:29.738 --> 00:00:31.448
We're not going to come
in second place again.

00:00:31.448 --> 00:00:32.616
To anyone.

00:00:32.783 --> 00:00:34.076
We're talking about discovering

00:00:34.076 --> 00:00:35.535
life on another planet.

00:00:35.619 --> 00:00:37.537
It'll change our
concept of who we are.

00:00:37.829 --> 00:00:38.830
Where we're going.

00:00:38.956 --> 00:00:41.291
♪ Black hole sun ♪

00:00:41.291 --> 00:00:42.668
♪ Won't you come ♪

00:00:42.668 --> 00:00:45.879
The massive dust storm has obscured
both landing sites.

00:00:46.171 --> 00:00:48.882
Years even decades of
planning comes down...

00:00:49.925 --> 00:00:50.926
To this moment.

00:00:53.762 --> 00:00:54.846
We're landing blind.

00:00:55.430 --> 00:00:56.348
Brace for impact.

00:00:57.641 --> 00:01:00.477
Being first is what
it's all about.

00:01:01.687 --> 00:01:04.815
♪ Won't you come ♪

00:01:04.815 --> 00:01:06.358
This is the resource that can

00:01:06.358 --> 00:01:08.360
support large scale
human colonization.

00:01:11.655 --> 00:01:12.990
Wanna tell us where
the water is?

00:01:13.532 --> 00:01:16.368
The survival of my
crew depends on it.

00:01:16.827 --> 00:01:21.707
♪ Won't you come ♪

00:01:26.003 --> 00:01:29.881
♪ Black hole sun ♪

00:01:30.382 --> 00:01:32.759
When united behind
a common goal

00:01:32.759 --> 00:01:34.219
there is nothing...

00:01:34.219 --> 00:01:35.429
We cannot achieve.

00:01:39.599 --> 00:01:40.684
It's only the beginning.

00:01:40.684 --> 00:01:45.328
♪ Won't you come ♪

